        ; Emit a choose expression (pattern match on union)
        ; choose_deref_subject#: `choose *p` over a union behind a pointer is
        ; `choose p`. The prefix `*` on a laid-out struct materialises a stack
        ; copy (emit_intrinsic_unary_op#: alloca + memcpy of the WHOLE union)
        ; before the tag is read, while a pointer subject GEPs straight into
        ; the union and each arm loads only its own payload — the same values,
        ; since a `when` binding is a copy of its arm either way. Measured on
        ; dazzle's `Insn` (80 B) when the tree was converted by hand: -3.7 % on
        ; the heaviest codegen. Answers the pointer, or null for any other
        ; subject (and for a `*` whose operand does not emit as a pointer).
        procedure choose_deref_subject(mutable this, mutable choose_expr: PlannedChoose) @direct true @deep true returns LLVMValueRef linked

















































        procedure emit_choose(mutable this, mutable choose_expr: PlannedChoose) @direct true @ret_caller true @deep true @deep_beyond_2 true returns LLVMValueRef linked













































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































